---
import StaticWikiPage from "../components/StaticWikiPage.astro";
import { getPageByRoute } from "../core/site-data";

const page = getPageByRoute("/faq/");
---

<StaticWikiPage page={page}>
  <h2>Fast Answers</h2>
  <h3>Is this the Steam game by Reissad Studio?</h3>
  <p>
    Yes. This site covers Bodycam, the Reissad Studio PC game on Steam,
    Steam App ID 2406770. It does not cover Roblox Bodycam experiences,
    camera hardware, films, or unrelated body-camera topics.
  </p>

  <h3>Is Bodycam still in Early Access?</h3>
  <p>
    Steam currently lists Bodycam as an Early Access game. That means current
    systems, requirements, settings, and patch details should be checked
    against official sources before release decisions.
  </p>

  <h3>What changed in Locked & Loaded?</h3>
  <p>
    Steam News records Locked & Loaded as the v0.8 update released on
    2026-09-02 at 17:00 UTC. The update context includes Trenches, loadouts,
    attachments, the tactical tablet, FPV drones, RC cars, sound work, mode
    changes, and follow-up hotfixes.
  </p>

  <h3>What is the safest first guide to read?</h3>
  <p>
    Start with <a href="/guides/getting-started/">getting started</a>, then
    check <a href="/guides/controls/">controls</a> and
    <a href="/guides/best-settings/">best settings</a> before copying any
    build, sensitivity, or performance advice from older sources.
  </p>

  <h3>Does Bodycam have a weapon builder here?</h3>
  <p>
    No. Weapon builder demand exists, but this project does not publish a tool
    until current weapon, attachment, and formula data are verified. The public
    <a href="/guides/loadouts-and-attachments/">loadouts guide</a> stays
    qualitative and avoids fake precision.
  </p>

  <h3>Is Bodycam on console?</h3>
  <p>
    This project only covers the PC / Steam / Windows version unless an
    official Reissad Studio or Steam source changes that scope. Do not treat
    competitor console pages as official availability evidence.
  </p>

  <h3>Are there Roblox codes or redeem codes?</h3>
  <p>
    This site does not publish Roblox Bodycam codes because that is a different
    search intent. No official Bodycam code system is verified for the current
    guide collection.
  </p>

  <h2>Claims This Site Avoids</h2>
  <p>
    Exact weapon stats, tier lists, player-count numbers, hidden formulas,
    future roadmap promises, and unsupported console claims are not stated as
    facts here. When a topic needs deeper data, the guide says so directly.
  </p>
</StaticWikiPage>
